  "goodToKnow": "Die Kontaktanzeige is a personal or lonely-hearts ad: eine Kontaktanzeige aufgeben. In the days before dating apps, newspapers like Die Zeit printed pages of them, full of abbreviations: NR (Nichtraucher), schlk. (schlank, slim), m. (mit), and phrases like sucht Sie für gemeinsame Zukunft. Some newspapers still have them, often witty. Today, Germans meet partners mostly through apps, friends or work. Plural: die Kontaktanzeigen."
